INTERNATIONAL JOINT CONFERENCES 

 

11th Conference of the Asia Chapter & 2nd Conference of the MENA Chapter of the AHRD

& 10th Conference on Knowledge, Economy and Management 

 November 8  10, 2012 ISTANBUL, TURKEY

------------------------------------------------------------------------

 

Dear Colleagues, 

 

It is my pleasure to invite you to the International Joint Conferences, which will take place in November 8-10, 2012, in ISTANBUL-TURKEY.  

 

The International Conference of Academy of Human Resource Developing (ASIA&MENA Chapter), and The International Conference on Knowledge, Economy and Management (ICKEM) bring together various researchers of the information revolution in academia and industry; engineers, social scientists, scholars and graduate students to exchange and share their experiences, as well as research results about all aspects of Human Resource Developing, Knowledge Management, Knowledge Society and Knowledge Economy, and to discuss challenges encountered, and solutions adopted. 

The Joint Conference has a very special place, as it is one of the very few continuous conferences regularly held in this field. The joint conference has teamed up with the International Journal of Knowledge Economy and Knowledge Management (The JKEM) for publishing a Special Journal Issue on Advances in HRD, Knowledge Economy and Knowledge Management.

 

Please note that the deadline for submitting abstracts is May 12, 2012.

For more information about the conference, please visit our website http://beykon.org

 

I look forward to seeing you in ISTANBUL.

Assoc.Prof. Ibrahim Guran YUMUSAK

Conference Chair

 

Istanbul Medeniyet University

E-Mail: kongre@beykon.org

